surname>Horikoshi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Yazaki</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Kadowaki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group>:<article-title>Troglitazone increases the number of small adipocytes without the change of white adipose tissue mass in obese Zucker rats</article-title>.<source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1998</year>;<volume>101</volume>:<fpage>1354</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1361</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9502777</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B4"><label>4.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tontonoz</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hu</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Spiegelman</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name></person-group>:<article-title>Stimulation of adipogenesis in fibroblasts by PPAR gamma 2, a lipid-activated transcription factor</article-title>.<source>Cell</source><year>1994</year>;<volume>79</volume>:<fpage>1147</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1156</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8001151</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B5"><label>5.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bjorntorp</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group>:<article-title>Fat cell distribution and metabolism</article-title>.<source>Ann N Y Acad Sci</source><year>1987</year>;<volume>499</volume>:<fpage>66</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>72</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3300494</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B6"><label>6.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kissebah</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name><name><surname>Vydelingum</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Murray</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>DJ</given